  "details": "Simple but annoying bug, in the most recent sdk, using UdonBehavior.Interact() to connect a button's OnClick to an Udon Script, makes the button double clickable, once when clicking down with the mouse, and one when lifting the mouse button. Should only be firing once but it double fires now, which can break some player-made UI animations and selections.\nThis can atm be bypassed by using the sendcustomEvent() command instead, but that can be messy so I'd love to see this bug fixed.",
